# Admin panel — generated content overrides.
#
# These live in `components/generated/` and ARE meant to be committed: the panel
# commits them through the GitHub API, and the components import them.
#
# NOT ignored here on purpose. An earlier revision ignored them so a local save
# without GITHUB_TOKEN would not land in a commit — but that also hid a
# legitimately committed file from `git status`, which is exactly the kind of
# invisibility that lets a real change go unnoticed. A local save without a
# token is already warned about in the panel UI, which is the right place for it.

